projectdescription:
Certified Professional Program - New Building - To construct a new 34-storey noncombustible building consisting of:

-1st storey - entrance lobby, a rental office (unit#101), a theater &  storages;
-2 nd storey - amenity spaces (cowork space & a gym ), storages;
-3rd to 33th storeys -    275 secured rental housing;
-34th storey - amenity roof deck;

all over 5 levels of below grade parking. 

This building is provided with a radio antenna system. 

This is the NORTH SITE.
07- Nov-2023 - Stage I ( Excavation and Shoring)  issued.
02- May-2024  -Stage II (Foundation to Grade, struct. only) issued.
28-May-2024 - Stage III (Full permit) issued.

Revision#1 -  change of the Envelope Engineer’s company (Stantec acquisition of Morrison Hershfield) effective
